## P8：修复异步时序统计

事件验证分两种模式。

### Ideal settling

允许：

```text
trial_time == settled_time
settled_time == cmp_request_time
```

但必须：

```text
cmp_done_time > cmp_request_time
commit_time >= cmp_done_time
next_trial_time >= commit_time
```

### Non-ideal settling

要求：

```text
settled_time > trial_time
cmp_request_time >= settled_time
```

正确 latency：

```python
stage_latency = commit_time - trial_start_time
```

不要把绝对 timestamp 当 latency。

同时应测试：

```text
|VDIFF| 较小 → comparator decision time 较长
|VDIFF| 较大 → comparator decision time 较短
```

